  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read task 001's `notes/spikes/001-schema-audit.md` + design §5/§8.2 + spec FR-08/FR-03 to fix the exact MUST-ADD column set + the confirmed `communicationUserId` target entities.</step>
    <step order="2">Via Dataverse MCP `describe`, re-confirm which of the target columns already exist and verify any option-set integers to be assigned (privacy/privilege choices).</step>
    <step order="3">Add to `sprk_communication`: privacy flag, internal-only flag, privilege classification (separate from privacy), ACS `messageId` (indexable/queryable for dedupe). Decide + document the ACS `chatThreadId` placement (child-table vs also a denormalized per-message read key).</step>
    <step order="4">Add `communicationUserId` to `systemuser` and `contact` per the audit.</step>
    <step order="5">Deploy to the project solution. Verify each column exists + is writable/queryable; verify the `messageId` supports a dedupe lookup.</step>
    <step order="6">Document the added columns (logical names + types + integers) for the 081 architecture doc + task 042/010 consumption. Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (005 ✅) + `current-task.md`; confirm 042 + 010 unblocked.</step>
  </steps>

